cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Proteus, please cite the software using the metadata in this file."
type: software
title: "Proteus: Scientific Image Processing Desktop Application"
abstract: >-
  Proteus is a desktop application for scientific image processing built
  with PySide6 and OpenCV. It provides interactive enhancement, analysis,
  visualization, region-of-interest, multi-band pseudocolor, and principal
  component analysis workflows.
